{{# The whole site map: a stable map f : (C, x1, x2, x3) -> X. It is rendered
    twice, because an SVG viewBox cannot change with a media query: once laid
    out left to right, and once top to bottom for narrow screens. CSS shows one
    of the two. #}}
<figure class="figure">
  <svg class="fig fig--wide" viewBox="40 40 940 345" role="group" aria-label="{{ ui[lang].figure_label }}">
    <g>{{ include "figure/curve.vto" }}</g>
    {{ include "figure/map.vto" { vertical: false } }}
    <g>{{ include "figure/target.vto" }}</g>
  </svg>
  <svg class="fig fig--tall" viewBox="0 0 420 835" role="group" aria-label="{{ ui[lang].figure_label }}">
    <g transform="translate(-30 -45)">{{ include "figure/curve.vto" }}</g>
    {{ include "figure/map.vto" { vertical: true } }}
    <g transform="translate(-585 450)">{{ include "figure/target.vto" }}</g>
  </svg>
  {{# The mathematics is MathML, so it is set in Asana Math with proper
      italics and script positions, and read correctly by screen readers. #}}
  <figcaption>
    {{ if lang === "zh" }}
    <b>图 1.</b> 一个亏格 2 的稳定映射 <math><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>X</mi></math>，插入为 <math><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>*</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></math>。
    {{ else }}
    <b>Figure 1.</b> A stable map <math><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>X</mi></math> of genus 2, with insertions <math><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>*</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></math>.
    {{ /if }}
  </figcaption>
</figure>
